1
00:00:10,666 --> 00:00:11,541
Father, what’s wrong?!

2
00:00:11,750 --> 00:00:13,583
The family tablet has shattered… 

3
00:00:14,541 --> 00:00:16,000
 House Carter is finished.

4
00:00:16,791 --> 00:00:17,583
That’s impossible!

5
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:20,083
House Carter is the most powerful 

6
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:21,583
noble family in Emeraldstone.

7
00:00:22,166 --> 00:00:24,333
How could we be destroyed in the blink of an eye?

8
00:00:24,750 --> 00:00:25,958
Exactly, this can’t be real.

9
00:00:27,166 --> 00:00:27,708
Correct.

10
00:00:28,541 --> 00:00:30,416
No one except the Sovereign Sanctum

11
00:00:30,416 --> 00:00:31,791
could pull off something like this.

12
00:00:34,791 --> 00:00:36,750
The family tablet has shattered.

13
00:00:36,750 --> 00:00:38,041
There’s no faking that.

14
00:00:44,250 --> 00:00:46,916
Which fool dares impersonate the Godfather?

15
00:00:46,916 --> 00:00:47,583
It’s him!

16
00:00:49,041 --> 00:00:51,166
You’re the one impersonating the Godfather?

17
00:00:53,250 --> 00:00:54,791
My lord, there’s been a misunderstanding.

18
00:00:55,125 --> 00:00:56,166
A misunderstanding?

19
00:00:57,125 --> 00:00:59,583
Are you saying I’m falsely accusing him?

20
00:01:01,708 --> 00:01:02,125
Boy, 

21
00:01:02,625 --> 00:01:05,000
why are you impersonating the Godfather?

22
00:01:05,833 --> 00:01:07,291
Because I am the Godfather.

23
00:01:08,250 --> 00:01:09,750
With your pathetic appearance, 

24
00:01:10,291 --> 00:01:12,791
 you dare claim to be the Godfather?

25
00:01:13,375 --> 00:01:15,500
Captain, he’s just a miner.

26
00:01:15,666 --> 00:01:17,541
Those are his buddies from the mines.

27
00:01:20,833 --> 00:01:23,541
A lowly miner dares impersonate the Godfather?!

28
00:01:24,041 --> 00:01:24,833
Seize him!

29
00:01:28,833 --> 00:01:30,500
I’d like to see who dares.

30
00:01:32,625 --> 00:01:34,166
And who the hell are you?

31
00:01:34,375 --> 00:01:36,958
I am the Judgment Knight of the Sovereign Sanctum,

32
00:01:37,708 --> 00:01:39,666
serving directly under the Godfather.

33
00:01:39,666 --> 00:01:42,750
These days even the con artists are working in teams.

34
00:01:43,041 --> 00:01:44,875
You look barely twenty.

35
00:01:44,958 --> 00:01:46,791
Now I'm certain you're all fakes.

36
00:01:48,041 --> 00:01:49,791
The Governor has arrived!
